73,96,19],[29327,34.9,1965,76,95,21],[29627,33.2,1965,76,95,23]],"links":[["Essex County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-york/essex-county"],["ARC or PLC in Essex County","/arc-plc/new-york/essex-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, May to June and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 31 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value ran July to August at 68% and August to September at 62%. Grid 28727 had its driest year in 1963 at 66%.</p>"}
